    const operatingRatio = allInflows ? Math.round(operating / allInflows * 100) : 0;
    return `<div class="page"><section class="hero-panel"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">FINANCE WORKSPACE / 01</div><h1>把每一笔资金，<br><span class="accent-text">变成可行动的判断。</span></h1><p>银行收款、银行对账、往来余额和现金预测在同一条资金航线上。先导入小样本，再确认口径和核销结果。</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="primary-button" data-route="imports">开始导入</button><button class="ghost-button" data-route="forecast">查看现金预测</button></div></div><div class="hero-orbit"><div class="orbit-ring"><div class="orbit-center">资金<br>主线</div><div class="orbit-node">银行收款</div><div class="orbit-node">应收</div><div class="orbit-node">应付</div><div class="orbit-node">导入</div></div></div></section><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>今日资金脉搏</h2><p>根据本地演示数据实时计算，金额单位为人民币</p></div><button class="muted-link" data-route="forecast">打开 90 天窗口 →</button></div><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-accent"></div><span class="metric-label">可用货币资金</span><strong>${money(forecast[0]?.balance || 0)}</strong><small>今日开盘余额</small></div><div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-accent"></div><span class="metric-label">应收未收</span><strong>${money(ar)}</strong><small class="warn">${state.sales.filter((row) => row.total > row.paid && new Date(row.due) < today).length} 笔已逾期</small></div><div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-accent"></div><span class="metric-label">应付未付</span><strong>${money(ap)}</strong><small class="warn">${state.purchases.filter((row) => row.total > row.paid && new Date(row.due) < today).length} 笔待处理</small></div><div class="metric-card"><div class="metric-accent"></div><span class="metric-label">本期银行净流入</span><strong>${money(cashIn - cashOut)}</strong><small>已分类流水 ${state.bank.length} 笔</small></div></div><div class="dashboard-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>现金余额趋势</h3><p>未来 30 天滚动预测</p></div><span class="status ok">可用</span></div><div class="chart-wrap">${chartSvg(forecast, true)}</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>最近动态</h3><p>导入和核销活动</p></div><button class="small-button" data-route="imports">查看全部</button></div><div class="activity-list"><div class="activity-row"><i class="activity-dot"></i><div><b>银行收款已归类</b><small>${escapeHtml(state.bank[0]?.subject || "客户XXX一号")} · ${formatDate(state.bank[0]?.date)}</small></div><span class="activity-amount">+${number(state.bank[0].in)}</span></div><div class="activity-row"><i class="activity-dot"></i><div><b>应收进入逾期</b><small>${escapeHtml(state.sales[2]?.customer || "客户XXX三号")} · ${ageLabel(state.sales[2]?.due)}</small></div><span class="activity-amount">${money(state.sales[2].total)}</span></div><div class="activity-row"><i class="activity-dot"></i><div><b>付款已核销</b><small>${escapeHtml(state.payments[0]?.supplier || "供应商XXX一号")} · ${formatDate(state.payments[0]?.date)}</small></div><span class="activity-amount">-${number(state.payments[0].amount)}</span></div></div></section></div><div class="overview-chart-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>未来 30 天流入 / 流出</h3><p>按 6 天窗口聚合，突出资金压力日</p></div><div class="chart-legend"><span><i class="legend-in"></i>预计流入</span><span><i class="legend-out"></i>预计流出</span></div></div><div class="flow-chart-wrap">${flowBarsSvg(flowRows)}</div><div class="flow-summary"><span>预计流入 <b>${money(flowIn)}</b></span><span>预计流出 <b>${money(flowOut)}</b></span><span>净流量 <b class="${flowIn - flowOut < 0 ? "warn-text" : ""}">${money(flowIn - flowOut)}</b></span></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>应收 / 应付到期压力</h3><p>按余额和到期日分层</p></div><button class="small-button" data-route="receivables">查看台账</button></div><div class="aging-chart">${agingBar(arAging)}${agingBar(apAging)}</div><div class="aging-legend"><span><i class="aging-swatch overdue"></i>逾期</span><span><i class="aging-swatch near"></i>0-30天</span><span><i class="aging-swatch mid"></i>31-60天</span><span><i class="aging-swatch far"></i>60天以上</span></div></section></div><div class="overview-signal"><div class="signal-copy"><div class="eyebrow">CASH QUALITY</div><h3>经营性收款占银行流入 <strong>${operatingRatio}%</strong></h3><p>贷款、注资和内部转账已从银行收款中剔除，避免把资金补充误判为经营表现。</p></div><div class="signal-meter" aria-label="经营性收款占比 ${operatingRatio}%"><span style="width:${operatingRatio}%"></span></div><div class="signal-values"><span><i class="legend-in"></i>销售收款 <b>${money(operating)}</b></span><span><i class="legend-other"></i>其他流入 <b>${money(Math.max(0, allInflows - operating))}</b></span></div></div><div class="node-strip"><button class="node-card" data-route="income"><i></i><b>银行收款</b><p>分类经营流入，排除贷款与内部转账。</p></button><button class="node-card" data-route="receivables"><i></i><b>应收账款</b><p>销售单减已核销收款，保留账龄。</p></button><button class="node-card" data-route="payables"><i></i><b>应付账款</b><p>采购单减已核销付款，连接排程。</p></button><button class="node-card" data-route="imports"><i></i><b>数据导入</b><p>六类模板，预览后再写入批次。</p></button></div></div>`;
